{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2020-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1600819200, "end_date": 1601510399, "month_true_total": 227, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:54:06 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "76798402", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999625843", "personaname": "Phizle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197999625843/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 4726, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1511, "last_played": 1609582258, "avatar": "c750f2411c8b5342ceaf13ab94c12eaeb981dbd2"}, "language": "english", "review": "A potentially fun game buried under bugs, lack of quality control, and outright hostile design.  I hope your enjoy dying hundreds of times because the cover system in a cover based shooter has been gutted and you can't read the developer's minds.\n\nAt $30 this might be worth it if like me you really love mass effect, but it lacks the polish and selling points of the original trilogy, or at least the latter 2 games.  A sequel with some polish applied to the new mechanics might be worth it as a standalone game.\n\nThere's about as much good content in this game as in ME2 and ME3, it's just spread out and diluted, and you have to learn how to work around the awkward cover system.", "timestamp_created": 1601446475, "timestamp_updated": 1607473482, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76791602", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024763351", "personaname": "Phae", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/parkerlathem/", "num_games_owned": 596, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 839, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 839, "last_played": 1601430941, "avatar": "bc3c6f700a140acfc0935de88ab6119e790bd017"}, "language": "english", "review": "I can only recommend this game one sale for incredibly cheap. It's mediocre at best.", "timestamp_created": 1601431019, "timestamp_updated": 1601431019, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.507142841815948486", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76791452", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043263617", "personaname": "MightyMatias", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mightymatias/", "num_games_owned": 594, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1665, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1057, "last_played": 1601739797, "avatar": "4568f29961684dda01d119b7417481c005be63dd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pick it up on sale. I've been having a blast with it. Of course I think the OG trilogy was way better, but this new entry does give me the feeling of exploring new worlds for the first time and settling colonies. Most of the bugs and visual glitches present at launch are gone. I haven't ran across any in my playthrough, and if I do I'll be sure to update this review.", "timestamp_created": 1601430662, "timestamp_updated": 1601430662, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76776766", "author": {"steamid": "76561198178525126", "personaname": "Serenity", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/serenitygr/", "num_games_owned": 231, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 5832, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5831, "last_played": 1601405791, "avatar": "2c55f289b1c6f730a5731a172af0a1a9cfdc54bd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, few bugs here and there, but so memorable.\nI really...really hope it gets a sequel...so much lore to explore.", "timestamp_created": 1601405711, "timestamp_updated": 1601405711, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76754603", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004778282", "personaname": "marabux", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198004778282/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 70, "playtime_forever": 4607, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 989, "last_played": 1664126316, "avatar": "e1c8e5037c97ef889b8b0687dd2cd94fc958cf25"}, "language": "english", "review": "Well, Graphics are awesome and picture and view and etc. Just as a the writing is terrible. Like a 14 year old was doing all the conversations or pixel starship crew or something. There is not enough mystery or detective edge, the game doesn't hold you like ME1-3 by the neck that you can't get enough. Boring for some reason. And again characters are awefully written.", "timestamp_created": 1601373693, "timestamp_updated": 1601373693, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.483870983123779297", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}